      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Black pepper",
      "amount": "1/8 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Balsamic vinegar",
      "amount": "1 tablespoon",
      "notes": "optional"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Rinse the olives and pat them dry with a paper towel.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the olives, olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, thyme, salt, and black pepper. Toss to coat.",
    "Spread the olive mixture on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the olives from the oven and let them cool slightly.",
    "Drizzle the balsamic vinegar over the olives, if using.",
    "Serve the olives warm or at room temperature.",
    "Garnish with fresh thyme, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
